# Copy to .env.local for local `netlify dev` runs. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# The deployed key lives ONLY in Netlify's environment UI — never in a committed
# file. Without it, /api/analyze returns a structured 503 and `analyze_trend`
# falls back to the committed summary in the fixtures. That is a supported
# state, not an outage.
#
# Free tier, no card required: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
